Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.45,0:00:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what are the odds\Nsomeone's got a similar handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, except this isn't similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.41,0:00:33.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna put it that\Nway, then yeah, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.53,0:00:36.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, that name's\Nnot really that unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.77,0:00:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, mine's an abbreviation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Kirito and\NGGO's name is... Kiri...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirigamine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Toguro Kirigamine or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better eat up or it's gonna get cold.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.05,0:00:56.88,OP-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Without a second thought, right now
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.05,0:00:56.88,OP-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k30}May{\k27}owa{\k26}zu {\k12}ni {\k22}i{\k167}ma
