Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.27,0:02:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet we were trying to kill each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.53,0:02:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.33,0:02:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making that scary face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it's not scarier than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.85,0:03:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I already know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.27,0:03:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you converted Kirito from ALO to\NGGO, so just drop the act already, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.65,0:03:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,did you honestly think\NI wouldn't notice when
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you suddenly vanished from my friend list?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.15,0:03:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd check\Nthat thing every five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't. I just knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.77,0:03:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night, I got this weird\Nfeeling and checked my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.25,0:03:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I saw you weren't on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:27.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I headed over to your room and\Nwas about to bust the door down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't, because I knew it'd\Npiss you off something fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also knew you'd never\Nquit ALO without telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured you must have a good reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.17,0:03:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I called Asuna up to\Nsee if she knew anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.53,0:03:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:43.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.98,0:03:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm not calling you too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I wasn't sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:51.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.13,0:03:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, you started to say\Nsomething, so just go ahead and say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:03:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:04:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I was just thinking about\Nhow I'd like to hear your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.91,0:04:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.41,0:04:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.05,0:04:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing's wrong. Long day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.59,0:04:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something happen in the\Ngame you converted over to?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.69,0:04:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.35,0:04:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.47,0:04:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the new job's overloading\Nyou, I could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.55,0:04:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.39,0:04:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, if you converted\Nover, you would get lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.85,0:04:33.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.93,0:04:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll be back before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.65,0:04:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need me, call, okay? Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.66,0:04:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night.
