Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.24,0:04:45.36,Phone,,0,0,0,,{\pos(912.75,254.25)\blur1.2\fscx90\fscy80\frz9.9\c&HB97BC5&\fax0.2}C{*\fax0.19}a{*\fax0.18}l{*\fax0.17}l {*\fax0.16}E{*\fax0.15}n{*\fax0.14}d{*\fax0.13}e{\fax0.12}d
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.57,0:04:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't drag Asuna into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.13,0:04:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's sure to show up\Nin B .O .B.'s main tournament
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:05:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my problem, not hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.35,0:05:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kazuto
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know what Asuna told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.65,0:05:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said not to worry, because once\Nyou tore up GGO, you'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She didn't say it, but I knew\Nshe was really worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.31,0:05:24.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you got home so late,\Nand when I saw your face,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to say something because you\Nlooked all freaked out. I did? Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.79,0:05:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're not doing anything crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.21,0:05:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because if you are, I couldn't bear\Nit if something happened to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be fine, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tonight's the last night of\NGGO's tourney, and after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.85,0:05:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back to ALO and here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be back no matter\Nwhat, so don't worry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.37,0:06:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was talking to Asuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just so happened\Nto tell me that you're
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.99,0:06:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna get a huge check from this new gig!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.35,0:06:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and when I get back,\NI'll treat you to something cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.95,0:06:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.95,0:06:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's this awesome\Nnew nano carbon Shino.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.35,0:06:20.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had my eye on oh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.23,0:06:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.73,0:06:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dumbass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:31.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He pisses me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so mad I could kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.01,0:06:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Yasuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're upset, but it's\Nweird to see how this worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.07,0:06:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's obnoxious, he's cocky,\Nand he's a dirty liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.81,0:06:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks he's such a big shot fighting\Nwith the sword, and GGO of all places.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tricked me into thinking he was a girl\Nand had me take him to the gun market.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:06:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I even helped him pick out his gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.39,0:07:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He thinks I'm an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.97,0:07:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.75,0:07:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.95,0:07:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that look for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's just that, like,\Nyou're acting kind of strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think you've ever talked\Nthis much about someone else before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding. Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you don't usually\Nlet people get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.47,0:07:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get like this when\Npeople push my buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.45,0:07:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how about we find a field\Nin the game and ambush him huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.27,0:07:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can lure him out\Nand then you can snipe him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although if you want to get him back\Nyou probably want to take him head on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.91,0:07:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way, I know I can find a couple\Nmachine gunners to back you up if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but I had\Nsomething else in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like yeah, he pisses me off,\Nbut when he fights at least he seems
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.23,0:07:56.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,honorable about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.41,0:07:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless I beat him fair and\Nsquare, it won't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.27,0:08:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in today's final,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna blow a hole through that dumb\Navatar of his if it's the last thing I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you mind surrendering, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a big fan of slashing at girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.43,0:08:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear I'm gonna pay you back\Ndouble for what you did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.31,0:08:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? What's wrong? Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.51,0:08:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you see what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, I didn't even notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.07,0:08:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it didn't bother\Nme because I was so mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.59,0:08:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:42.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.65,0:08:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.17,0:08:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.65,0:08:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about you, that's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.17,0:08:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not acting like\Nyour usual self today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.33,0:08:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:58.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.16,0:08:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I usually act?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I've known you, you've\Nbeen cool, calm, and level-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.41,0:09:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing gets to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.71,0:09:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got the same problems at school as\Nme, but you didn't run away like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.79,0:09:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're like, really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.63,0:09:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not strong at all. You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.67,0:09:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get freaked out whenever I see a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.67,0:09:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Sinon doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.01,0:09:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got that amazing rifle\Nand knows how to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, that's who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know one day, you'll be\Nlike that in real life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.01,0:09:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why, when you go ballistic\Nover that guy, I start to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I see you lose it like\Nthat, I want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.59,0:09:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.19,0:09:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.39,0:09:52.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to be normal once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.75,0:09:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I laughed and cried just like anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.59,0:10:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't become who I am\Nnow because I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate\Nyou wanting to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially since you're\Nthe only one in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who really understands\Nwhat I'm going through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.09,0:10:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just not ready to be\Nanyone's girlfriend yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, I can't really fix what's\Nbothering me unless I do it on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.39,0:10:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.81,0:10:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, do you think\Nyou could wait for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.59,0:10:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
