Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.31,0:11:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you the real deal or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.79,0:11:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.21,0:11:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you Kirito? Are you Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, kiddo? You\Nlook like you've seen a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:12:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no it's nothing you got\Na super hot nurse sitting
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:05.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here offering free counseling\Nand you're gonna pass it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.47,0:12:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on tell me what's bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well since you put it that way I guess\NI don't really have a choice do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.87,0:12:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, before you came to the rehab\Nunit, you were in trauma, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.57,0:12:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.07,0:12:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a personal question, and if you\Ndon't want to answer, I totally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.53,0:12:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the patients you've cared for,\Ncan you remember the ones who died?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.85,0:12:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess if I think about it, I\Ncan recall their faces and names.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.27,0:12:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even patients I only spent\Nan hour or so with in the OR.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.51,0:12:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you ever wish you could\Njust forget about those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's a tough one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.11,0:12:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure if this is an answer,\Nbut it's the best I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.89,0:13:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I think if something's\Nmeant to be forgotten,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.99,0:13:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a person will end up forgetting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.61,0:13:06.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without even thinking they want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.57,0:13:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the more a person wishes\Nthey could forget something,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the stronger the memory becomes, till\Nthey can't stop thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:20.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if that's the case, then maybe\Nsubconsciously, whatever the memory is,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's something that\Nshouldn't be forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.71,0:13:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then if I forgot, I must be a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I was stuck in SAO, I took out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:37.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I killed three people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.67,0:13:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were all red players.\NSo murder was their.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.35,0:13:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,business and I could have\Noverpowered them instead
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of killing them but I\Nwent ahead and killed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them anyway I did it out\Nof rage hatred revenge
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.95,0:13:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And over the past year,\NI've totally forgotten all
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about those people even as\NI sit here talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.89,0:14:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't remember what two of them\Nlooked like or what their names were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.35,0:14:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can forget people I killed,\Nwhat's that say about me? as a person?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.37,0:14:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kirigaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm not the awesome counselor
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.57,0:14:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could take away\Nthe burden you're carrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.09,0:14:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or at least help share the? load of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never even played sword art online.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you say you killed someone,\NI don't even know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.49,0:14:43.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, there's one thing I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.01,0:14:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When all's said and done,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the reason you did what you did was\Nto save someone else, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.11,0:14:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the medical field, sometimes\Nwe have to choose who to save.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make the decision\Nto let someone die any easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:14:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a life-or-death situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.97,0:15:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone's got the right to consider the\Npeople they can save over those they can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.09,0:15:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.27,0:15:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just think about the lives\Nof all the people you saved,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you'll make peace with your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.91,0:15:16.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.91,0:15:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to believe you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.63,0:15:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I killed them, and I can't\Neven remember who they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.07,0:15:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I don't even\Ncare that they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.73,0:15:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve to find any peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you didn't care about what you did,\Nyou wouldn't be suffering like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.07,0:15:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep down, you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.25,0:15:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when the time's right,\Nit'll all come back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it does, and it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.93,0:16:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make sure you remember\Nall the people who were
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.03,0:16:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,alive today because you\Nwere there to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.41,0:16:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need me, call, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.25,0:16:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, thank you. You know for the pep talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.67,0:16:38.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure i'm glad i could help i don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.55,0:16:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anything will happen till after eight o\N'clock i should be out by 10 at the latest
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.99,0:16:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, here I go. Okie doke,\Nbon voyage, you super stud, you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.65,0:16:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Link, start
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.65,0:17:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.07,0:17:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.53,0:17:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I will beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.51,0:17:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Link, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, Klein! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.35,0:17:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, an invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.41,0:17:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's being extra manly today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:17:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.65,0:18:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Klein, we're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.31,0:18:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your time, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.25,0:18:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.79,0:18:10.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.79,0:18:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.79,0:18:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Asuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need a hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alpine to Asuna! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sue, Nila, Hale, Astro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.95,0:18:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.19,0:18:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to space out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.49,0:18:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, it's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.81,0:18:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No harm, no foul, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.31,0:18:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, today's your boy's big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.35,0:18:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, Kirito's tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna start soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:18:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I say we quit early and get\Nover to our room to watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.61,0:19:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we use the cash we scored\Ntoday to buy beer and snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.87,0:19:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think we're gonna\Nlet you blow all our money on food?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.25,0:19:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.89,0:19:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy's gonna win today, you'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.95,0:19:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:20.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter where he goes, Kirito\Nknows how to handle himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.75,0:19:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we don't want to miss the first match,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.31,0:19:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so let's start heading\Nover to Yggdrasil City.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.73,0:19:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.33,0:19:49.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, folks, place your bets.
