Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.93,0:20:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're gonna win this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.27,0:20:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.43,0:20:19.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I thought I'd find a bar\Nsomewhere and watch the feed from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.98,0:20:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll track you down after this\Nand we can toast my victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or cry in our beers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.61,0:20:29.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sinon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Asada.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.19,0:20:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wondering if you\Nmeant what you said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.63,0:20:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asked me to wait for you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you won this thing and\Nconquered your fears, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe we could go\Nout and stuff? What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.19,0:20:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're bringing this up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just that I care\Nabout you so much, Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.85,0:20:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.89,0:20:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to focus on the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.39,0:21:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't have a chance of winning\Nunless I put everything I've got into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.93,0:21:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.03,0:21:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, I believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll wait till you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.75,0:21:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.83,0:21:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I better go get ready now. See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.71,0:21:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be rooting for you. Good luck.
